Walkie-Talkie Features
​Real-time Voice: Instant push-to-talk communication.
​Group Channels: Open air channels for public or team coordination.
​Private Lines: Users who pay for extra features unlock the ability to create exclusive, private lines for their personal friends.
​Business Integration: Company subscriptions link directly to user accounts, allowing businesses to manage employee access and secure internal channels through one dashboard.
​Custom Notifications: This is where you set the Bruce Mobile sound for the church old-school alert.
